    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just distress though. i don't think i'm just \"feeling\" this way. i think it's actually true. when you look at what i actually did... it's not like a mistake you just move past. it's who i am. i feel like i'm just taking up space that someone better would use. someone who isn't a burden.",
